{{also|tauón|táuon|taŭon}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|en|tau|on}}, [[tau]] short for {{der|en|grc|τρίτος||third}}, being the third [[lepton]] discovered.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# An [[unstable]] [[elementary particle]] which is a [[type#Noun|type]] of [[lepton]], [[have#Verb|having]] a [[mass#Noun|mass]] almost [[twice]] that of a [[proton]], a [[negative#Adjective|negative]] [[charge#Noun|charge]], and a [[spin#Noun|spin]] of [[½]]; it [[decay#Verb|decays]] into [[hadron]]s (usually [[pion]]s) or other leptons, and [[neutrino]]s.
#: {{synonyms|en|tau|tau lepton|tau particle}}

